    {
      "area": "Package products",
      "description": "Pure, host-testable modules: Math, Simulation, Scenes, ShaderSource, EffectsGraph, Diagnostics (+ placeholders AudioDSP, Persistence, TestSupport). iOS modules: Rendering, Effects, Automation (Debug/measurement) (+ placeholders UI, Audio). Rules R1–R5 enforced by scripts/check_dependencies.py.",
