    "reasons": [
      "Every brainstorm capability maps to existing VisualCore API (4 available) or an additive gap (6 rows).",
      "All 7 gaps are additive VisualCore modules or helpers owned per Principle II; none needs a second renderer, a fork, private API or networking.",
      "Reference regression baseline recorded green (T-A01-006) and the empty shell builds on both simulator runtimes (T-A01-008).",
      "Phase 01 starts with G-PARAMS (VisualCoreParameters) and the app's GPU-free domain.",
      "A01-P01 closed G-SHADERLOAD, G-GLSLLIB and G-PARAMS in VisualCore; M01 and M05 are now available.",
      "A01-P02 closed G-CLOCK (SceneClock) and added ParameterEditor and ParameterPanel to VisualCore; M02 is available.",
